{
  "entries": [
    {
      "offset": "0x2e6e6a",
      "back_en": "cold-eyed man gazing down at her.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Equivalente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e6e8d",
      "back_en": "Ah... hhhh...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Interjeição idêntica."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e6e9b",
      "back_en": "Vurai...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Nome mantido."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e6eeb",
      "back_en": "Princess... No, Anju.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e6f5b",
      "back_en": "disdainful.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Equivalente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e6f67",
      "back_en": "You are still too small and too weak.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Sentido preservado."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e6fc4",
      "back_en": "What can you kill? What can you conquer?",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'accomplish' (realizar) virou 'conquistar'; melhor 'realizar/alcançar'."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e701d",
      "back_en": "you are powerless, and that is all you are.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e7049",
      "back_en": "What... What is he saying...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e7116",
      "back_en": "stand and lead us? The Eight Pillar Generals?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e71fa",
      "back_en": "flickering tail?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fragmento obscuro; tradução plausível dado contexto desconhecido."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e720f",
      "back_en": "Ludicrous.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Equivalente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e7273",
      "back_en": "You have no right to rise above me.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Sentido preservado."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e7314",
      "back_en": "This is the will of the heavens.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e7365",
      "back_en": "Yamato's summit. One chosen by the heavens!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e7391",
      "back_en": "Ah... hh...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Interjeição."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e73cd",
      "back_en": "victorious in this war!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e73e5",
      "back_en": "Anju. You will bow before me.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e746c",
      "back_en": "as a sacrifice on my road to conquest.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e7493",
      "back_en": "Nh... hh... hhh...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Interjeição."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e74a6",
      "back_en": "No... I will not...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e74ba",
      "back_en": "I... I do not wish for Yamato...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e74db",
      "back_en": "...to become... such a place...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e7571",
      "back_en": "not allow such submission, then?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e7592",
      "back_en": "Very well. For that, you shall have my mercy.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel; 'terás' tom arcaico coerente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e75c0",
      "back_en": "Vurai tosses a single dagger at Anju's feet.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e75ed",
      "back_en": "Use it.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e75f5",
      "back_en": "If you truly do not wish to live a life of",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e7622",
      "back_en": "shame, then end your life with your own hands.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e76a0",
      "back_en": "Ah... hhh...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Interjeição."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e76db",
      "back_en": "empty eyes.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e76e7",
      "back_en": "N-No... I... do not wish to...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e775d",
      "back_en": "I am so afraid...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e77cf",
      "back_en": "in control.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e77db",
      "back_en": "Please... someone... help...!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e7a6b",
      "back_en": "Anju--",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e7bc8",
      "back_en": "...Oshtor.",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "Source diz 'Vurai' mas target diz 'Oshtor'; nome divergente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e7bf5",
      "back_en": "This is it. This is exactly what I had hoped to see.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'exatamente' adicionado, leve mas aceitável."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e7d42",
      "back_en": "Even now, you still mock me, Oshtor?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e8049",
      "back_en": "Indeed... Maybe that is why you lost to Oshtor.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e8127",
      "back_en": "Hm? I was just commenting that perhaps that",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e8166",
      "back_en": "Strong or not, whoever underestimates the opponent fails",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "Voz mudou de 2ª pessoa ('you will fail') p/ impessoal; preferir manter 'você falhará'."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e819a",
      "back_en": "the opponent. It seems natural that he",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel; 'only' omitido sem prejuízo."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e81e0",
      "back_en": "I will say only this: you will never be able",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'serão capazes' = plural; source singular 'you will'."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e820f",
      "back_en": "to defeat Oshtor. Ever.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e823f",
      "back_en": "...Such audacity... You run your mouth too much,",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e8354",
      "back_en": "Very well. Then prove to me... your worth!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e8736",
      "back_en": "U-Understood!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e8744",
      "back_en": "You dare hurt Her Highness... Vurai, you are a",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e8775",
      "back_en": "villain, unfit for your title. I will render",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Frase cortada; equivalente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e87b5",
      "back_en": "I... will not falter. I am the sworn brother--",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "Source 'my sworn brother's' (possessivo); target perdeu 'my'/posse."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e87e7",
      "back_en": "no... the Imperial Guard of the Right,",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e8810",
      "back_en": "Oshtor's sword!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e8b92",
      "back_en": "Show the power... of the Akuruturuka.",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'Show me' virou 'Mostrem' (plural, sem 'me'); perdeu o objeto/singular."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e6d44",
      "back_en": "But before they can solidify, they are engulfed",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e6ea4",
      "back_en": "Her lifeless eyes cloud over, ever so slightly,",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e7891",
      "back_en": "gently, a trickle of blood running down her",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e7a12",
      "back_en": "In her hand she holds a dagger, pointed directly",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e7d0d",
      "back_en": "his hard expression returns to Oshtor almost",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'glare' como 'expressão dura'; aceitável."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e7f68",
      "back_en": "power.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e7f6f",
      "back_en": "I do not deny it. But regardless of his",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e807f",
      "back_en": "Something snaps at her words. A deadly pressure",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e865f",
      "back_en": "That's right. I thought I was used to the",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e8946",
      "back_en": "Atuy... do whatever you want.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    }
  ],
  "reviewed": 64
}